Lynx changes to ImGuiColorTextEdit (TextEditor.h / TextEditor.cpp)
==================================================================
- Fonts : SetFonts(regular, bold, italic, boldItalic, scale) ; keywords in bold,
  comments in italic, known identifiers in bold italic (monospace fonts with the
  same advance in every style, e.g. JetBrains Mono). Line height = 1.32 x size.
- Selection : rounded rectangles whose corners follow the lines above / below,
  softer when the editor is not focused.
- Current line : a soft band (no outline), its line number in the text color.
- Matching brackets around the cursor are framed (strings / comments skipped).
- Occurrences of the selected word (or of the word under the cursor) are framed,
  and marked in the vertical scrollbar (with the diagnostics and the cursor line).
- Diagnostics : SetDiagnostics(ranges + severity) -> wavy underline (error /
  warning / info), dotted underline (hint).
- SetBuiltinTooltips(false) : no identifier / error marker tooltips (the host
  shows its own hover).
- Host helpers : GetMouseCoordinates, CoordinatesToScreenPos, GetLineHeight,
  IsTextHovered, IsFocused, GetLineText, GetLineIndexOf / GetColumnOf,
  GetTextVersion, ReplaceRange (one undo step), SuppressKeys (completion list
  keys), SetLinkUnderline (Ctrl + hover).

